From 7f9ed8515625f5149dc074d13bd50e451a442a59
Subject: Download the rebuilt Windows x64 prebuilt
Origin: https://github.com/robtfm/client-sdk-rust/commit/7f9ed8515625f5149dc074d13bd50e451a442a59
Date: 2026-10-25T23:41:13+00:00

The webrtc-a545de4-prefixed Windows x64 archive had lost every symbol of
its NASM-built members: llvm-objcopy 21 writes those COFF objects back
with an empty symbol table. webrtc-a545de4-prefixed-2 carries the same
five other archives and a Windows x64 archive rebuilt member by member,
with the assembly objects renamed through their string tables instead.
The extraction directory changes with it so a cached target never serves
the old archive.
---
diff --git a/webrtc-sys/build/src/lib.rs b/webrtc-sys/build/src/lib.rs
index 75a5fe1bf998d489ecd9583ecfea6f0c3791c694..35f30181cd77600a357fb706d05927b0aee6ba7b 100644
--- a/webrtc-sys/build/src/lib.rs
